    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Liquid Lungs is an adrenaline-fueled first-person shooter that merges fluid parkour with high-intensity combat. Inspired by the free-running thrills of classic parkour games and the relentless pace of modern arena shooters, this dystopian adventure delivers a seamless blend of movement and marksmanship that keeps you always on the edge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Parkour-Fueled Combat</strong><br>Race across rooftops, leap between walls, and slide under obstacles while engaging in relentless gunfights. Every level is designed for swift traversal, challenging you to combine acrobatics with precise shooting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bullet Time and Dodge Mechanics</strong><br>Channel your inner Max Payne by triggering slow-motion events and executing dodge moves. Slip past incoming attacks with pinpoint timing before retaliating with deadly precision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dystopian Cityscapes</strong><br>Explore a near-future world dominated by towering structures and neon-lit corridors. Each location encourages creative use of your parkour skills, rewarding those who master every inch of verticality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arsenal and Secrets</strong><br>Experiment with a broad range of weapons to match your personal style. Unlock new gear as you progress, and keep an eye out for hidden secrets that add depth and replayability to every run.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Liquid Lungs is an adrenaline-fueled first-person shooter that merges fluid parkour with high-intensity combat. Inspired by the free-running thrills of classic parkour games and the relentless pace of modern arena shooters, this dystopian adventure delivers a seamless blend of movement and marksmanship that keeps you always on the edge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Parkour-Fueled Combat</strong><br>Race across rooftops, leap between walls, and slide under obstacles while engaging in relentless gunfights. Every level is designed for swift traversal, challenging you to combine acrobatics with precise shooting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bullet Time and Dodge Mechanics</strong><br>Channel your inner Max Payne by triggering slow-motion events and executing dodge moves. Slip past incoming attacks with pinpoint timing before retaliating with deadly precision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dystopian Cityscapes</strong><br>Explore a near-future world dominated by towering structures and neon-lit corridors. Each location encourages creative use of your parkour skills, rewarding those who master every inch of verticality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arsenal and Secrets</strong><br>Experiment with a broad range of weapons to match your personal style. Unlock new gear as you progress, and keep an eye out for hidden secrets that add depth and replayability to every run.</p>",
    "short_description": "Liquid Lungs is a high-speed FPS blending fluid parkour with intense combat. Inspired by free-running action games and fast-paced shooters, it delivers a seamless mix of movement and marksmanship in a dystopian world. Run, jump, and fight in a nonstop adrenaline rush where every motion counts.",
